               <text>
                  <paragraph>colloidal silicon dioxide, copovidone, croscarmellose sodium, FD&amp;C blue #1, hypromellose, lactose, magnesium stearate, microcrystalline cellulose, polyethylene glycol, povidone, pregelatinized starch, sodium starch glycolate, stearic acid, titanium dioxide</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20121217"/>
            </section>
